{:paths ["src" "test" "resources" "lib" "examples" "ontology"
         "vendor/src" "vendor/resources"]
 ;; mithril does not depend on kotoba-lang. The paths above used to be sibling
 ;; checkouts ("../org-w3-json-ld-api/src", "../io-multiformats/src", ...) and
 ;; :deps used to pin io.github.kotoba-lang/* git URLs. Those repositories were
 ;; removed when kotoba-lang consolidated into the kotoba-lang/kotoba-lang
 ;; monorepo, so neither form resolved outside a developer's machine.
 ;;
 ;; The same code is now committed under vendor/ as a pinned snapshot owned by
 ;; this repository. See vendor/PROVENANCE.md and vendor/PROVENANCE.json.
 ;;
 ;; There is deliberately no :deps key. The vendored code is plain source on
 ;; the :paths above, so no dependency resolution is needed; leaving an empty
 ;; :deps {} here makes nbb shell out to `bb uberjar` against a classpath-less
 ;; cache config, which fails with "The uberjar task needs a classpath".
 ;; The :deps map previously carried the same pins as deps.edn plus, for the
 ;; IPQ/1 loopback interoperability test (checkpoint_ipq), kotobase-protocol-ipq
 ;; and kotobase-protocol-core -- both supplied by hand on the classpath before,
 ;; same shas as deps.edn. They are vendored too.
}